OL,3,GNEWSAAnti-migrant protesters gather as
OL,4,Asmall boat lands on south coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FProtesters have gathered in a south
OL,7,Fcoast town as a small boat believed to
OL,8,Fbe carrying more than 100 migrants was
OL,9,Fbrought ashore.
OL,11,FA number of people were seen arriving
OL,12,Fat a marina in Gosport, Hampshire,
OL,13,Fhaving been transported aboard two RNLI
OL,14,Fboats late on Sunday evening. The
OL,15,Fdinghy appeared to have set off from
OL,16,Fnear the Utah Beach area of Normandy
OL,17,Fduring the morning, according to ship
OL,18,Ftracking data.
OL,20,FFrench media reported there were about
OL,21,F120 migrants on board.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
