OL,3,GNEWSAAnti-migrant protesters gather as
OL,4,Asmall boat lands on south coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FHampshire Police said it had deployed
OL,7,Fofficers to Gosport to "support our
OL,8,Fpartners in the event of an emergency
OL,9,Fat sea". The force imposed conditions
OL,10,Funder the Public Order Act as well as
OL,11,Fpowers prohibiting the wearing of face
OL,12,Fcoverings.
